<view class="page-shell profile-page">
  <app-brand></app-brand>
  <view class="profile-hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">本机内容</view>
    <view class="page-title">我的<text class="period">。</text></view>
    <view class="lead">文章和资料，默认保存在这台设备上。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="tool-list">
    <view class="tool-row"><button class="tool" bindtap="openMenu"><view class="tool-icon"><image class="book-image" src="/assets/book.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><view><text>作品与备份</text><small>管理、导出或恢复这台设备上的文章</small></view><b>›</b></button></view>
  </view>
</view>
<app-nav active="profile"></app-nav>

<view wx:if="{{menuOpen}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeMenu" catchtouchmove="noop">
  <view class="backup-sheet" catchtap="noop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="作品与备份">
    <view class="sheet-handle"></view>
    <view class="sheet-brand">岁月有声</view>
    <view class="sheet-heading"><view>作品与备份</view><button bindtap="closeMenu" aria-label="关闭">×</button></view>
    <view class="sheet-tools">
      <button bindtap="manageWorks"><view class="sheet-icon"><image class="sheet-book" src="/assets/book.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><view><text>管理作品</text><small>导出、复制或移入回收站</small></view><b>›</b></button>
      <button bindtap="openRecycle"><view class="sheet-icon undo-icon">↶</view><view><text>回收站</text><small>恢复误删的作品</small></view><b>›</b></button>
      <button bindtap="exportBackup" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="sheet-icon">→</view><view><text>导出全部备份</text><small>保存为 JSON 文件</small></view><b>›</b></button>
      <button bindtap="importBackup" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="sheet-icon">✓</view><view><text>从备份恢复副本</text><small>不会覆盖现有作品</small></view><b>›</b></button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="notice">{{busy}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice" role="status">{{notice}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-panel" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
    <view class="sheet-note">
      <view>作品只保存在本机；“已保存”表示已写入当前微信用户、当前小程序 AppID 和这台设备，不是云备份。清理小程序数据或更换 AppID 后可能丢失，请定期手工导出备份。</view>
      <view>小程序不请求手机号、头像或昵称。长按语音时当次音频会经岁月有声服务发送腾讯云转写；只有明确发送给小文并同意后，必要内容才会发送 DeepSeek，候选仍需确认。</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
